DESCRIPTION:The UWF Historic Trust\, Pensacola Bay Brewery\, Juan's Flying
  Burrito and Lucy's in the Square team up for a progressive haunted dinne
 r tour on Thursday\, October 8. The night starts at 6:30 PM at the brewer
 y with ghost stories and a cold beer\, moves on a ghost tour through Sevi
 lle Square\, and stops at Juan's Flying Burrito for a quesadilla bar\, a 
 salsa bar and a margarita. It ends at Lucy's in the Square with dessert a
 nd a spooky cocktail.\nPrice: from $75\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: Thursday 
 10/8 · 6:30 PM\nChecked against the venue's own page on 2026-10-07\nhttp
 s://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-hp-boos-brews-and-chews-progressive-ha
